        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.653,
            0.278,
            0.67
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 11.3"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.13,
            0.674,
            0.724,
            0.742
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) How much current will an electric bulb draw from a 220 V source, if the resistance of the bulb filament is 1200",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Ω"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "? (b) How much current will an electric heater coil draw from a 220 V source, if the resistance of the heater coil is 100",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Ω?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.75,
            0.225,
            0.765
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Solution"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.767,
            0.719,
            0.8
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) We are given "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "V=220\\;V;R=1200\\;\\Omega."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " From Eq. (12.6), we have the current "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "I=220   V /1200   \\Omega=0.18   A"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.8,
            0.483,
            0.817
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) We are given, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "V=220   V ,   R=100   \\Omega."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.817,
            0.721,
            0.869
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "From Eq. (11.6), we have the current "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "I=220\\; V /100\\;\\Omega=2.2\\; A ."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Note the difference of current drawn by an electric bulb and electric heater from the same 220 V source!",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
